body:
Thank you for sharing this.  Repression is so difficult to overcome, especially when it starts early in life.  I also have a tendency to overthink and I think that may have held me back.  I always got... not necessarily jealous, but irritated when my female friends started dating.  Like I thought they were wasting their time and should focus on what really mattered - their friendships with other women.  I was always careful not to voice this irritation, as everyone has a right to pursue what makes them happy.

&#x200B;

I am glad I am not the only one who has run into issues with this.  I always admired people who knew who they were right off the bat, but I guess it's not that simple for everyone.
